# Generated artifacts: local merge helpers; validate/recompute over the integrated tree.
#
# 6 of 6 consecutive merges on 2026-09-06 conflicted on exactly these files, and
# none of those conflicts was a disagreement about code. A hand-merged digest is
# a hash that matches nothing; an index needs independent path/title coverage validation.
#
# Enable once per clone:   bash scripts/setup_merge_drivers.sh
#
# docs/INDEX.md moved to merge=union on 2026-10-21 (operator-approved process plan). Its rows
# are now `path | title` only, and `report_docs_inventory.py --check-index` checks presence and
# title per doc, not row order or content hashes. Local Git can union-merge adjacent additions
# (built-in, no per-clone config); the check rejects missing, stale, duplicated or mistitled rows.
# GitHub server-side mergeability does not honor these merge drivers, including union.
# Sibling PRs can therefore still conflict. Regenerate over the integrated tree; see the
# PROPOSED docs/designs/DSN-20261024-doc-index-pr-flow.md for an artifact/batch alternative.
docs/INDEX.md                                                        merge=union

# Append-only wave log: union-merge so concurrent sessions appending at the same
# time do not conflict. 5 of 12 commits in two hours touched the ledger on
# 2026-09-20 and three upstream commits exist only to clear its conflict markers.
#
# merge=union is a local Git built-in: no per-clone driver config is needed.
# GitHub server-side mergeability can still conflict; this is not a GitHub conflict guarantee.
#
# Deliberately scoped to the _LOG file only. The status table in the main ledger is
# edited in place and is shrink-only; union there would duplicate rows and emit two
# `as_of:` lines. Same reason AGENTS.md is excluded — see
# tests/test_generated_file_merge_driver.py::test_agents_md_is_deliberately_not_covered.
docs/audits/DARK_PARTIAL_CLOSURE_LEDGER_*_LOG.md                     merge=union
docs/implementation/maturity-program/*/FULL_TEST_MATRIX.txt          merge=regenerate
docs/implementation/maturity-program/*/RUFF_SHELLCHECK.txt           merge=regenerate
docs/implementation/maturity-program/*/CONTROL7_WORKFLOW_PROOF.txt   merge=regenerate
docs/implementation/maturity-program/*/CONTROL7_LOCAL_EQUIVALENT.txt merge=regenerate
